- xtask tooling and Cargo dependencies are attributed in Cargo.lock and their own licenses.
- pdfium (https://github.com/chromium/pdfium) — BSD-3-Clause; pdfium-render — MIT/Apache-2.0.
- monolith (https://github.com/Y2Z/monolith) — CC0-1.0.
